{"strings": {"Assets/Content/Notes/Gatehouse/Guards's note.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Guards's note": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Hey,\n\n\nSo, I've gotta get something off my chest. Working at this dump has been driving me up the wall lately. You wouldn't believe the crap I have to put up here. I'm so tired of guarding those two cells.\n\nAlways the same old faces end up here. Blabbering, yelling and other shit happens all the time. I can't watch TV in peace!\n\nAnd the stench coming from those cells could knock you out cold! Bucket toilets? Seriously?\n\nI have so many things to complain about! All the nonsense they talk to me, my lunch breaks are a disaster... I could go on and on with this list!\n\nI'm hoping that you could bring some sanity back to this place.\n\nDecember 25 - August 28.": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/Notes/Gatehouse/Prisoner's note.asset": {"NoteInfo:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Prisoner's note": {"NoteInfo:title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "For the other inmates who have wandered in here.\n\nCaves\nAhead are caves that lead to an old water tunnel. Unfortunately it's a dead end! There is a floodgate that could perhaps be opened somehow from the other side. I don't know who dug those huge tunnels. Maybe old mines? Anyway, they're gone.\n\nPipe room\nThe door is closed! I couldn't find a way to get out!\n\nI haven't found any way to get out!\n\n- L.H": {"NoteInfo:content": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Ambience": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Light": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Ugu": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Rocs": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Rain": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Fuses": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Lamp": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Wood sounds": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Music": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Machine 1": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Machine 2": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Machine 3": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Pipe": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Pipe 2": {"Soundscape:loopSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Spooky sounds": {"Soundscape:randomSounds[].title": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Assets/Content/TaskItems/Task items/Miner Registration.asset": {"TaskItem:addressableAssetPath": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "miner registration": {"TaskItem:id": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Miner Registration": {"TaskItem:itemName": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Prefabs/Items/": {"CollectibleItem:prefabPath": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Evotan bottle": {"CollectibleItem:Item.name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Osmo Olut bottle": {"CollectibleItem:Item.name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Milk": {"CollectibleItem:Item.name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Mushroom Rollie": {"CollectibleItem:Item.name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Matchbox": {"CollectibleItem:Item.name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, " Bolrmaro Cigarette": {"CollectibleItem:Item.name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Osmo Olut Can": {"CollectibleItem:Item.name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Microwaved Turnip": {"CollectibleItem:Item.name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Pluto candy bar": {"CollectibleItem:Item.name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Plastic Bottle": {"CollectibleItem:Item.name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Kilju": {"CollectibleItem:itemSpawnInfo.liquid.liquidItems[].name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Plastic bottle": {"CollectibleItem:Item.name": ["sharedassets19.assets"]}, "Water": {"CollectibleItem:itemSpawnInfo.liquid.liquidItems[].name"